OL,3,GNEWSAMineshaft halts major dump
OL,4,Aclearance after one day
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to clear an illegal waste dump
OL,7,Fground to a halt on the first day after
OL,8,Fa coal mine was discovered under the
OL,9,Fsite.
OL,11,FWigan Council said efforts to remove
OL,12,Fthe 18,000-tonne pile on Bolton House
OL,13,FRoad in Bickershaw, Wigan, was stopped
OL,14,Fbecause of "historical mineshafts on
OL,15,Fsite that could cause a risk with
OL,16,Frepeated heavy lorry loads".
OL,18,FAbout 18,000 tonnes of rubbish, on
OL,19,FBolton House Road near Bickershaw,
OL,20,FWigan, had been building up since 2024.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
